# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Mintline environment
#
# NOTHING HERE IS REQUIRED FOR `npm run dev` OR `npm test`.
# With no DATABASE_URL the app runs on an embedded PGlite
# database in `.mintline-data/` and everything else works.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Production / shared-database connection string.
# Required in production. Neon Postgres, reached via the Neon HTTP driver.
# Set it on the deployment platform, never in git.
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://USER:PASSWORD@HOST/DATABASE?sslmode=require

# Signs the anonymous session cookie.
# Required in production so sessions survive a redeploy and stay
# valid across serverless instances. Generate one with:
#   node -e "console.log(require('crypto').randomBytes(32).toString('hex'))"
# SESSION_SECRET=

# Canonical origin used for metadata, OpenGraph, sitemap and share links.
# Set this to the real production alias after the first deploy.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://<your-alias>.vercel.app

# Where the embedded PGlite database writes. Use ":memory:" for
# ephemeral local state.
# MINTLINE_PGLITE_DIR=.mintline-data